<title>PHILIPPINES: ING-Barings Manila unit proposes Europeso issue.</title>
<headline>ING-Barings Manila unit proposes Europeso issue.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>ING Barings had proposed to arrange a Philippine peso-denominated bond in the international debt market, ING Baring deputy manager for the Philippines Consuelo Garcia said on Monday.</p>
<p>ING Barings proposed to float at least $50 million worth of Euro-peso bonds, she said.</p>
<p>Garcia told reporters the issuer could be any triple A-rated institution or any other multilateral institution looking for alternative investment opportunities.</p>
<p>She did not give details.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
